config BR2_PACKAGE_HBAS_GPSD
	bool "hbas-gpsd"
	help
	  u-blox GPS reader for hogtied-ui: finds the receiver's baud rate
	  (stock's 9600 -> PUBX,41 -> 57600 first), parses NMEA, serves the
	  fix on /run/hbas/gps.sock and sets the system clock from GPS time.
	  Sources live in software/gpsd in the HogTiedOS repository.
